--- long-iso
N NNNN-NN-NN NN:NN new
N NNNN-NN-NN NN:NN old
--- iso
N NN-NN NN:NN new
N NNNN-NN-NN  old
--- +%Y/%m/%d
N NNNN/NN/NN new
N NNNN/NN/NN old
--- +old %Y
new %H
N new NN new
N old NNNN old
--- locale
N Oct NN NN:NN new
N Jan  N  NNNN old
--- posix-long-iso
N Oct NN NN:NN new
N Jan  N  NNNN old
--- full-iso
N NNNN-NN-NN NN:NN:NN.NNNNNNNNN ZONE new
N NNNN-NN-NN NN:NN:NN.NNNNNNNNN ZONE old
--- --full-time
N NNNN-NN-NN NN:NN:NN.NNNNNNNNN ZONE old
--- a bad style
ls: invalid argument 'bogus' for 'time style'
Valid arguments are:
  - [posix-]full-iso
  - [posix-]long-iso
  - [posix-]iso
  - [posix-]locale
  - +FORMAT (e.g., +%H:%M) for a 'date'-style format
Try 'ls --help' for more information.
rc=2
